      "body": "I like the look of the bar now. It's a little confusing that if you click on it it doesn't go away because you're still hovering it. I wonder if we can make it go away and just reappear when you hover again. @disconcision might have more styling opinions though.\r\n\r\nSidenote: this also links to the local branch name on github which could not be the upstream branch name. I don't think many people are doing this so I'm not really concerned but it could be something we try to handle.",
